/* =====================================================================
   NEW DISTRICTS (v5): five more parts of Meridian Reserve Bank, written
   in the compact step format described at the top of expeditions.js.
   They are merged into FUNCTIONS, MAP_GROUPS and COMPACT on load, so
   every process here is walkable and checked by validateExpeditions().

   Write each step so the field's read lands on the verdict you intend:
   the verdict comes from the profile (p), the first capability in best,
   the autonomy (auto) and feasibility/value (fv), through verdictOf().
   ===================================================================== */

